OL,3,GNEWSADigger driver helps tackle
OL,4,A'dangerous' wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who used a digger to help prevent
OL,7,Fa wildfire from spreading said
OL,8,Fadrenaline kept him going - but he
OL,9,Fwould leave it to the professionals
OL,10,Fnext time.
OL,12,FDanny Wadman said he received a call
OL,13,Ffrom a neighbour about smoke and flames
OL,14,Ffrom the fire heading towards his
OL,15,Fworkplace at Inferno Groundworks, near
OL,16,FMawgan Porth, Cornwall, on 11 August.
OL,18,FTo help stop the flames spreading, the
OL,19,F28-year-old from Newquay got in a
OL,20,Fdigger to create a gap in vegetation
OL,21,Fand trees, known as a firebreak.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
