OL,3,GNEWSADigger driver helps tackle
OL,4,A'dangerous' wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fundraising page has been set up to
OL,7,Fhelp pay for repairs on the digger
OL,8,Fafter the fire caused significant
OL,9,Fdamage to the vehicle including,
OL,10,Fblowing its tyres out and its front
OL,11,Fbucket falling off.
